{"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracking plan is how the people and services that read an app’s events learn what each event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holds, so it is only useful while it matches the events. With this test, a change to an event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doesn’t pass the app’s tests until the plan is exported again, and reviewers see the change as a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"JSON diff of the plan. The test’s report also says which changes would break payloads from released"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app versions or records already stored."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlanTesting\/documentation\/TrackingPlanTesting\/expectTrackingPlan(_:matches:sourceLocation:)"},{"type":"text","text":" checks a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TrackingPlan"},{"type":"text","text":" against the plan"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"committed in a directory, as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TrackingPlan.check(againstDirectory:)"},{"type":"text","text":" does. When they differ, it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"records a Swift Testing issue whose comment is the check’s report, the same text the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"check"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"command prints, and it returns the check either way. A plan that is only out of date fails the test"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as a breaking one does: in both cases the committed plan isn’t what exporting the events writes."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the product to an app’s test target, so the check runs wherever the app’s tests do. It imports"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Swift Testing, so it belongs in test targets only. To run the check from the command line or CI"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"without a test, use the app’s own "},{"code":"TrackingPlanCommand","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" executable from "},{"code":"TrackingPlans","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import Foundation","import Testing","import TrackingPlanTesting","","@Test func eventsMatchTheTrackingPlan() throws {","    let directory = URL(fileURLWithPath: #filePath)","        .deletingLastPathComponent()","        .appendingPathComponent(\"TrackingPlan\")","    expectTrackingPlan(try AppTrackingPlan.trackingPlan, matches: directory)","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The guide "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingplanworkflow","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"covers exporting the plan this test checks."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"title":"Checking from a test","anchor":"Checking-from-a-test","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlanTesting\/documentation\/TrackingPlanTesting\/expectTrackingPlan(_:matches:sourceLocation:)"]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Framework","externalID":"TrackingPlanTesting","modules":[{"name":"TrackingPlanTesting"}],"symbolKind":"module","role":"collection","title":"TrackingPlanTesting"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Fail a Swift Testing test when an app’s events no longer match its committed tracking plan, so every change to an event comes with a change to the plan."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackingplantesting"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlanTesting\/documentation\/TrackingPlanTesting","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"references":{"https://tyler-keith-thompson.github.io/Traffluent/documentation/traffluent/trackingplanworkflow":{"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingplanworkflow","title":"Exporting and Checking a Tracking Plan","url":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingplanworkflow","type":"link","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"Exporting and Checking a Tracking Plan","type":"text"}]},"doc://TrackingPlanTesting/documentation/TrackingPlanTesting":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackingplantesting","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Fail a Swift Testing test when an app’s events no longer match its committed tracking plan, so every change to an event comes with a change to the plan."}],"type":"topic","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlanTesting\/documentation\/TrackingPlanTesting","title":"TrackingPlanTesting"},"doc://TrackingPlanTesting/documentation/TrackingPlanTesting/expectTrackingPlan(_:matches:sourceLocation:)":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackingplantesting\/expecttrackingplan(_:matches:sourcelocation:)","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Records a Swift Testing issue when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"plan"},{"type":"text","text":" no longer matches the plan committed in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"directory"},{"type":"text","text":", its comment the check’s report, as the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"check"},{"type":"text","text":" command prints it."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"expectTrackingPlan","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"TrackingPlan","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A4PlanV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"matches","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"URL","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials3URLV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sourceLocation","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SourceLocation","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Testing14SourceLocationV"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TrackingPlanCheck","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A9PlanCheckO"}],"title":"expectTrackingPlan(_:matches:sourceLocation:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlanTesting\/documentation\/TrackingPlanTesting\/expectTrackingPlan(_:matches:sourceLocation:)"}}}